# One whole sentence for each count, never a word slotted in.
unlock_replace_passkey_one = Ku deji furaha gelitaanka kombiyuutarkan oo hilmaan midka laga kaydiyay kombiyuutar kale?\n\nWindows wuxuu ku weydiin doonaa inaad ku xaqiijiso Hello. Furihii hore ee gelitaanka ee kombiyuutarka kale ku hadhay halkaas lama taaban doono wuuna sii shaqayn doonaa haddii aad galkan halkaas ku celiso, laakiin waa in mar kale la dejiyaa.
unlock_replace_passkey_many = Ku deji furaha gelitaanka kombiyuutarkan oo hilmaan {count} oo laga kaydiyay kombiyuutaro kale?\n\nWindows wuxuu ku weydiin doonaa inaad ku xaqiijiso Hello. Furayaashii hore ee gelitaanka ee kombiyuutarka kale ku hadhay halkaas lama taaban doono wayna sii shaqayn doonaan haddii aad galkan halkaas ku celiso, laakiin waa in mar kale la dejiyaa.
unlock_method_works = Habkaas wuu shaqeeyaa.

plain_text_password_found = data\config\himalaya.toml weli waxay ka kooban tahay eray sir qoraal caadi ah (auth.raw) oo ka yimid dejinta akoon hore.\n\nKa saar akoonkaas oo mar kale ku dar, ama tirtir data\config\himalaya.toml si loo soo celiyo isagoo isticmaalaya kaydka aqoonsiga ee ammaanka ah.

