cache_clear_confirm = Nadiifi cache-ka fariimaha aan khadka ahayn ee akoon kasta?\n\nTani waxay tirtirtaa nuqullada maxalliga ah ee ZBox oo keliya. Waxba looma tirtiro server boosto oo kasta, fariimahana mar kale ayaa la soo dejin doonaa marka aad u baahato.
account_remove_confirm = Ka saar {name} ({address})?\n\nBoostada server-ka lama tirtiro.\nNuqullada kombiyuutarkan lagu soo dejiyay waa la tirtiraa.\nErayga sirta ee la kaydiyay waa la tirtiraa.
folder_delete_confirm = Si joogto ah u tirtir galka "{folder}" iyo wax kasta oo ku jira {address}?\n\nTan laga noqon mayo.
empty_trash_confirm = Si joogto ah u tirtir dhammaan fariimaha Qashinka ku jira ee {address}?\n\nTan laga noqon mayo.
empty_junk_confirm = Si joogto ah u tirtir dhammaan fariimaha Spam ku jira ee {address}?\n\nTan laga noqon mayo.
sync_select_account = Dooro akoon (ma aha gal Midaysan) si loo isku-dubaridey isticmaal aan khadka ahayn.
accounts_imported = {count} akoon ayaa la soo geliyay:\n\n{names}\n\nErayada sirta weligood lama dhoofiyo, kaydka erayada sirta ee sirta lagu geliyay wuxuu u gaar yahay akoonkan isticmaalaha Windows, sidaas darteed akoon kasta oo la soo geliyay wuxuu u baahan yahay in erayga sirta lagu qoro hal mar iyada oo loo marayo Qalabka > Dejinta akoonnada iyo shakhsiyaadka ka hor inta aanu isku xirmin.
accounts_import_none = Akoonno lagama helin faylkan. Dejinno weli waa la soo geliyay, haddii faylku haystay.
delete_permanently_confirm_one = Si joogto ah u tirtir fariintan? Tani waxay ka boodaysaa galka qashinka laguna laaban karo mayo.
accounts_locked = Erayada sirta ee akoonnada la kaydiyay waxaa lagu qoray kombiyuutar kale, sidaas darteed halkan lagama akhriyi karo.\n\nAkoon kastaa waa inuu mar kale ku galo server-ka boostadiisa. Si aad taas uga fogaato mar dambe, ku deji eray sir oo weyn Dejinta, Amniga barnaamijka iyo xogta kombiyuutarka akoonnadu horay ugu shaqeynayeen.
master_password_remove_confirm = Ka saar erayga sirta ee ugu weyn? Erayada sirta ee akoonnada la kaydiyay markaas waxaa lagu akhriyi karaa kaliya kombiyuutarkan iyo akoonkan Windows. Haddii aad ZBox u koobiyeyso meel kale ka dib, akoon kastaa waa inuu mar kale galo.\n\nHadda ka saar?
shortcut_offer = Miiska saar gaaban-fure ZBox?\n\nWaxay bilaabi doontaa galkan ZBox:\n{path}\n\nGaaban-furuhu wuxuu duubaa meeshan saxda ah. Haddii aad galka ZBox dambe u guurto, fur Dejinta, Aagga ogeysiisyada iyo daaqadda oo mar kale dooro Abuur gaaban-fure miiska si uu ugu tilmaamo meesha cusub.
shortcut_created = Gaaban-fure waa la abuuray:\n{path}

