# The lock screen and the Unlock Methods dialog: its notes, the name
# a button takes when it is unavailable, and every status line.
unl_note_locked = ZBox waa xiran yahay. Isticmaal mid kasta oo ka mid ah hababka hoose si aad u furto. Joojintu waxay xirtaa ZBox iyadoo aan akoon la furin.
unl_note_foreign_passkey = Furaha gelitaanka ee lagu kaydiyay galkan wuxuu iska leeyahay kombiyuutar kale, sidaa darteed halkan lagu isticmaali karo mayo. Ku fur furahaaga amniga ama erayga sirta ee ugu weyn, ka dibna isticmaal Dejinta, Amniga, Habab furid si aad furaha gelitaanka ugu dejiso kombiyuutarkan.
unl_note_methods = Mid kasta oo kuwan ka mid ah wuxuu furaa ZBox marka xirmada barnaamijku shidan tahay, iyo erayga sirta ee ugu weyn. Furaha gelitaanku wuxuu isticmaalaa Windows Hello kombiyuutarkan; furaha amniga waa fure FIDO2 oo ku yaal USB ama NFC wuxuuna ka shaqeeyaa kombiyuutar kasta oo aad ku xirto.
unl_note_not_encryption = Kuwani waxay furaan barnaamijka. Wax sir kuma geliyaan: erayga sirta ee ugu weyn ayaa weli ah kan keliya ee furi kara erayada sirta ee akoonnada la kaydiyay kombiyuutar aan galkan weligiis lagu isticmaalin. Waa in marka hore la dejiyaa, midna lagama dari karo ilaa taas la sameeyo.
