unl_status_cancelled_passkey = Furaha gelitaanka waa la joojiyay. ZBox weli waa xiran yahay.
unl_status_cancelled_key = Furaha amniga waa la joojiyay. ZBox weli waa xiran yahay.
unl_status_enter_password = Geli erayga sirta ee ugu weyn.
unl_status_no_master = Eray sir oo weyn lama dejin, sidaa darteed fure gelitaan ama fure amni weli lagama dari karo. Deji mid badhanka Erayga sirta ee ugu weyn ee Dejinta, Amniga, ka dibna halkan ku soo noqo. Erayga sirta ee ugu weyn waa kan furaya erayada sirta ee akoonnadaada la kaydiyay kombiyuutar kale; furaha gelitaanku wuxuu furaa barnaamijka kan keliya, sidaa darteed keligiis istaagi karo mayo.
unl_status_unsupported = Windows-ka kombiyuutarkan ma taageero furayaasha gelitaanka ama furayaasha amniga, sidaa darteed erayga sirta ee ugu weyn oo keliya ayaa halkan ku furi kara ZBox.
unl_status_foreign_one = 1 fure gelitaan ayaa iska leh kombiyuutar kale, halkanna ma furi karo ZBox. Dib-u-xil-siintu waxay ku beddeshaa mid kombiyuutarkan lagu sameeyay.
